frontend: react
backend: python
db: sqlite


Phase 1: 

onboarding page:
    - ask user name and email for notification purposes
    - provide photos of items you have in your home (optional, if not provided assume person is using zym, has most of the euqipments)
    - your full picture a shirtless is recommended for better fitting suggestions.
    - target body focus: give multiple options for body focus areas (e.g., arms, legs, torso) to tailor suggestions (multi selections + custom input for specific areas).
    - food preferences(optional): allow users to select dietary preferences (e.g., vegetarian, vegan, gluten-free) and any allergies.

    submit button: "Prepare Planning"

    once submitted:
        two agents will be created:
            - agent 1: responsible for generating a personalized workout plan based on the user's inputs.
            - agent 2: responsible for generating a personalized meal plan based on the user's dietary preferences and allergies.